.SS " bool jinja2\&.runtime\&.AsyncLoopContext\&.last ( self)"

.PP
.nf
Whether this is the last iteration of the loop\&.

Causes the iterable to advance early\&. See
:func:`itertools\&.groupby` for issues this can cause\&.
The :func:`groupby` filter avoids that issue\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.PP
Reimplemented from \fBjinja2\&.runtime\&.LoopContext\fP\&.
.SS " int jinja2\&.runtime\&.AsyncLoopContext\&.length ( self)"

.PP
.nf
Length of the iterable\&.

If the iterable is a generator or otherwise does not have a
size, it is eagerly evaluated to get a size\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.PP
Reimplemented from \fBjinja2\&.runtime\&.LoopContext\fP\&.
.SS " t\&.Union[t\&.Any, 'Undefined'] jinja2\&.runtime\&.AsyncLoopContext\&.nextitem ( self)"

.PP
.nf
The item in the next iteration\&. Undefined during the last
iteration\&.

Causes the iterable to advance early\&. See
:func:`itertools\&.groupby` for issues this can cause\&.
The :func:`jinja-filters\&.groupby` filter avoids that issue\&.

.fi
.PP
 
